{# The "Updates" section of the daily email: the informational lane. One card
   per informational finding routed to this pipe since the last drain (seeds,
   reminders, heads-ups from other systems). These are content, NOT incidents --
   no severity/type framing, never an "Open incident". Inline `{{ }}` only and
   `{% ... -%}` whitespace control: the Environment uses trim_blocks=True, so a
   bare `{% endfor %}` at end-of-line eats the per-iteration newline and
   collapses the cards onto one line. See incident-status.j2 for the same
   footgun. Renders to the empty string when there is nothing informational, so
   the "\n\n".join in _render_preamble drops it cleanly. #}
{% if informational_since_last_drain %}
Updates ({{ informational_since_last_drain|length }}):
{% for u in informational_since_last_drain -%}
- {{ u.body.title|default(u.body_text|default(u.entity, true), true) }}{{ " (" ~ u.body.source ~ ")" if u.body.source else "" }}
{% if u.body.body -%}
  {{ u.body.body }}
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% endif %}
